@startuml
title Beaver's Choice Paper Company - Pydantic AI Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #2F4054
  ArrowColor #2F4054
}

actor "Customer" as Customer
rectangle "External Customer Agent\nMaintains customer context\nand negotiation points" as CustomerAgent
database "SQLite database" as DB
collections "CSV reference data" as CSV
cloud "Tavily web search" as Tavily

package "Exactly five agents" {
  rectangle "1. Orchestrator Agent\nReceives text request,\nextracts date and intent,\ndelegates and combines responses" as Orchestrator
  rectangle "2. Inventory Agent\nChecks stock and thresholds;\ncreates replenishment decisions" as Inventory
  rectangle "3. Quoting Agent\nUses prices, quote history,\nand volume discounts" as Quoting
  rectangle "4. Ordering Agent\nValidates availability,\ncalculates supplier delivery,\nrecords sales or stock orders" as Ordering
  rectangle "5. Financial Agent\nReports cash, inventory value,\nassets, and top sellers" as Financial
}

Customer --> CustomerAgent : request + customer context
CustomerAgent --> Orchestrator : enriched JSON request\n(context + negotiation points)
Financial --> DB : init_database()\ngenerate_sample_inventory()
Financial --> Financial : run_test_scenarios()
Orchestrator --> Inventory : parallel: inventory check /\nrestock request
Inventory --> DB : get_all_inventory()\nget_stock_level()
Inventory --> Tavily : supplier_research()\nonly if replenishment is needed
Tavily --> Inventory : supplier options + sources
Inventory --> Orchestrator : stock status + replenishment plan

Orchestrator --> Quoting : parallel: normalized request + date
Quoting --> CSV : quote_requests.csv\nquotes.csv
Quoting --> DB : search_quote_history()
Quoting --> Orchestrator : itemized quote + discount explanation

Orchestrator --> CustomerAgent : offer + inventory/quote JSON\n(round 0 or 1)
CustomerAgent --> Orchestrator : accept / decline /\nrevised_request
Orchestrator --> Inventory : revised request (round 1 only)
Orchestrator --> Quoting : revised request (round 1 only)

note over Inventory,Quoting
These delegations run concurrently.
The Orchestrator joins both JSON results
before calling Ordering.
end note

Orchestrator --> Ordering : accepted order + date\n(only after customer acceptance)
Ordering --> Inventory : final availability check
Ordering --> DB : get_stock_level()\ncreate_transaction()
Ordering --> Ordering : get_supplier_delivery_date()
Ordering --> Orchestrator : fulfillment result + delivery date

Orchestrator --> Financial : post-transaction report request
Financial --> DB : get_cash_balance()\ngenerate_financial_report()
Financial --> Orchestrator : financial snapshot

Orchestrator --> Customer : text response\nquote, status, delivery,\nfinancial information

note right of Orchestrator
No agent-to-agent hidden state:
all hand-offs are validated JSON
containing normalized item names,
quantities, and ISO dates.
end note

note bottom of DB
Transactions are the source of truth.
Stock orders increase stock and reduce cash;
sales reduce stock and increase cash.
end note

note over CustomerAgent,Orchestrator
At most two negotiation rounds total.
CSV attempt IDs are scenario.round (base.0, base.1).
No ordering transaction occurs before acceptance.
end note

note right of Tavily
Advisory context only.
SQLite and the internal delivery
calculator remain authoritative.
end note
@enduml
